  "description": "Cross-platform MCP server for inspecting and controlling Game Boy and Game Boy Color ROMs. Exposes CPU stepping, breakpoints, memory, PPU/VRAM inspection, savestates and inline screen captures over the Model Context Protocol. Pure managed core (no native dependencies).",
  "id": "Zafiro.GameBoy.Debug.Mcp",
